{"server":"tw","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_01_beg","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_01","title":"金盞花","storyCode":"NL-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"5886d2b5229466c9eb9f679d5ea10d45aff23e21f19e53eea9c77fcbcb1a4da2","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔2 1-1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，德羅斯特女士......您在看什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不入流的詩集，麥基先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......您一直很喜歡這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還記得我第一次見到您，在那處滿是血腥與鐵銹氣味的競技場裡，您也是捧著這樣一本書，好像與周圍格格不入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您對這些細節，似乎記得很清楚......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......哈哈，慚愧，我也是您的粉絲之一。如果有空，可要您為我簽個名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"榮幸之至。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"麥基先生，打擾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"您要的酒就放在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝，代我向其他工作人員問好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們慶祝一下吧，德羅斯特女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樂意至極。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乾杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乾杯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，確實是好酒，價格驚人的高盧藏品，配得上今天這樣的日子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有您這樣的騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您過獎，我只是個幸運兒罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這本詩集......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我家鄉的一位無名詩人，我很喜歡他的句子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，萊塔尼亞的詩集......是叫《兩個月亮與金盞花》？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的萊塔尼亞語一向很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，只是必要的外交學習。我猜您喜歡金盞花？今天的卡西米爾已經很少有人懂得欣賞詩歌了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......字符終歸脫離不了想像，這些都只是想像的符號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對當代人而言，詩歌不過是毫無美感的文字迷宮，自作多情，矯揉造作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許卡西米爾人已經習慣於別樣的消費，而詩歌總是與這類消費無緣，這很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您似乎別有所指？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是談論詩歌，麥基先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您應該還有些話要對我們說吧，女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......是什麼呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，您的新眼鏡很適合您，麥基先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......您、您居然能注意到這種事，真讓人意外，哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，不過，您該說的不是這個，先前在城際網路和紙媒上出現的一些謠言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......紅酒浴池？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，那是對您聲譽的詆毀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的會有人用紅酒泡澡嗎？不會黏答答的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？大概......我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......這種新聞又有誰會信呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人會信的，德羅斯特女士......會有很多人信的。哪怕他們知道真相未必如此，他們也願意摻和這些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事後澄清一下不就行了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，女士，您總是把騎士之外的事情想得太簡單了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經聯絡了玫瑰新聞報業的總部，這是某家娛樂報刊的編輯私人所為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎在發現的時候已經引起了不小的反響，出於各種考量沒有立刻撤回......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是他們的工作方式，我不怪他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您很寬容，但這更讓我為您感到委屈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您把幾乎所有私人收入都捐贈給了萊塔尼亞的貧困地區，為家鄉修建學校，建設移動平台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但就算現在闢謠，經歷過狂歡的群眾也不會去在意真相如何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傷害和詆毀是很簡單的，他們會把這些謠言和噱頭握在手上，奔相走告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可您幾時見過，真相揭露以後，這些曾經傷害過您的人會去幫您洗清冤屈，澄清事實的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些八卦能讓人們感到新鮮刺激，澄清事實卻是一件無聊的事情，這也是理所當然的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，您怎麼這麼無所謂呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您這樣清正廉直的騎士應該成為其他人的榜樣！這本該讓您有更好的名聲，而且——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麥基。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很感動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是個多愁善感的人......也是個溫柔的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......作為聯合會發言人，保證各位騎士不受場外因素干擾，也是我應該做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，請您多在乎一下自己的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......對了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"決鬥賽的賽程表什麼時候發佈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......您怎麼連自己的比賽都不上心呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不出意外，您的下一個對手是灰須騎士，之後是......耀騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您很吃驚嗎，女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。耀騎士，瑪嘉烈·臨光......這個名字我聽過很多次了，很美，剛強，又優雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聯合會希望您獲勝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"燭騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“燭”和“耀”，我又有什麼勝算呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說，現在的騎士封號更多考慮的是傳播度，與實力無關，德羅斯特女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您很強大。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——我贏了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"該死！你耍詐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，老弗依舊無比強壯~♪科瓦爾是手下敗將~♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"你喊“開始”的時候故意打了個嗝對吧！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"別抄那張凳子，科瓦爾，那張不夠結實，換一張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"手下敗將~♪科瓦爾~♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......玩什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"扳手腕，你拎著的是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛買的藥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，是給瑪恩納送去的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但他多半是不會理我的吧。再說我也不覺得他會按時換藥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然性格大相徑庭，但有些地方，他和那姐妹倆還真像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說了，他和瑪嘉烈正兒八經地進行了一場決鬥，瑪嘉烈贏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定這樣才能讓那個瑪恩納清醒一點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，我才不覺得那個小子有什麼好清醒的，他清醒得很，太清醒了，才變成現在這副鬼樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪恩納他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，沒什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"各位！啊，佐菲婭姐姐也在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭？你怎麼一個人來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才騎士協會的人來找姐姐，我就自己先過來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"像姐姐這樣曾被流放過，又重新取回身份的例子似乎不多，有很多法律文件要審查......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，這群人當年拼了命地陷害瑪嘉烈，現在又這麼乾脆地承認她了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"有詐吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前我就在思考這件事，您二老能不能偶爾說點好話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是擔心嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"真有什麼問題，大不了我們一起捲舖蓋離開卡西米爾，去那個什麼......什麼德羅島逛逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭，你叔叔他......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......瑪恩納叔叔應該還在工作，說不定快下班了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"耀騎士是不是狠狠教訓了那個小子一頓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，早該這樣了，要是臨光老爺還在，一定不會看著那小子這麼自甘墮落——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔輸了那場決鬥，所以姐姐才能像今天這樣重回賽場。現在叔叔已經不會多說什麼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，那個瑪恩納會服軟......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，可是他們兩個決鬥的時候，叔叔直到最後都沒有使用過半點法術......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"......啥？瑪恩納在放水？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"怕是不敢全力以赴，在給自己的失敗找退路吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......服軟，放水，當然不可能，他會是這種性格嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......他是在看不起瑪嘉烈，他看不起耀騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他單純地不屑施展自己的法術，僅此而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“灰毫”格蕾納蒂，你看見索娜了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"就在那......為什麼你只有在叫我的時候要帶上封號？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我可以改。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你不喜歡的話......只是覺得，你給我的印象是這樣罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"過來吧，人都到齊了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"來了來了，你的傷沒事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"不礙事......這是什麼？一個玩偶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，我也是個女孩子嘛，喜歡可愛的東西有什麼不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......索娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，我知道，現在沒有開玩笑的餘地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"“工業事故”越來越頻繁了，他們在驅趕感染者，在感染者和貧民窟之間散播恐慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"既然無胄盟已經打算撕破臉皮，感染者們再躲躲藏藏也不是個辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"瑟奇亞克告訴了我們一些很有趣的情報，我們得趕緊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"——索娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"你有些心不在焉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果有一天......我們重獲自由......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......到那時候，你想做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"到那時候再想也不遲，我們一起想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"今天是怎麼了......你怎麼突然這麼多愁善感？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，沒什麼，走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"去見見紅松騎士團的新成員們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"滄桑的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......這裡，幾乎都是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙啞的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"會被國民院盯上的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"滄桑的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......被國民院盯上好歹光明正大，大不了多花點錢，解決法律問題的最好辦法就是花錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"滄桑的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"可再這樣下去......無胄盟會袖手旁觀嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙啞的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"無胄盟？那種東西真的存在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"滄桑的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"別把他們當都市傳說比較好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"滄桑的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，那邊正走過來的，她們就是紅松的騎士們吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"滄桑的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，乍一眼看上去，還不過是一群孩子罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"滄桑的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"但......也許有些事情，也只有年輕人去做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙啞的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"“焰尾”索娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙啞的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"“灰毫”格蕾納蒂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙啞的騎士","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“遠牙”查絲汀娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“正義騎士號”","speakerId":"avg_4000_jnight_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（響亮的滴滴聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙啞的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。還有一位庫蘭塔似乎不在這裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"滄桑的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們加入這些年輕人的計畫，就能活下去嗎？活下去之後呢？下個月？明年？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙啞的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者常說一件事，老朋友，事在人為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙啞的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得了礦石病，有不少人選擇聽天由命得了......我們的生命註定短暫，而且隨時是個危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙啞的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"可我想......感染者又不是一定會在第二天死翹翹，既然我們有這麼多個第二天，就該狠狠幹上一票。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......人數在變少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只靠這種小動作，終歸是救不了所有感染者的，索娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道，所以我們必須儘快找到突破口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......只靠著幾個感染者成為騎士之後的特權和財富，能在這座城市做什麼呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們用來為這些感染者搞慈善的錢，你們這些毫無意義的遮掩，在城市的下水溝裡苟且偷生的棚屋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一切都是這座城市賦予你們的，你們沒有什麼突破口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，話說得真難聽啊，塑膠騎士閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你的家族呢，瑟奇亞克？騎士貴族們沒有為你費盡心思討好那些企業家們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"被商業聯合會針對的你，和我們沒有區別。認清自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵......也是，我們都是被傾倒到這裡的垃圾，確實沒有什麼區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是叫格蕾納蒂？騎士貴族，這種東西從扈從團建立的那一刻就已經完蛋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可別說你還對你過去的家族抱有幻想 ，小松鼠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"（你是不是以為他會和你吵起來？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......你比我想的冷靜些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你知道嗎，我巴不得現在就離開這裡，天曉得你們什麼時候會把礦石病帶給其他人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但看你們這樣一時半會似乎也死不了，那就讓我們把注意力放在別的事情上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"無胄盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......聯合會的下賤爪牙，我會讓他們後悔的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，既然你們敢這麼和無胄盟作對......總得有點底牌吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......零號地塊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，大騎士領感染者集中醫療部門，由多家企業聯合負責的感染者收治區......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這些感染者騎士不是那裡的常客嗎？所以呢？無胄盟在那裡有什麼秘密？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"——慢著，瑟奇亞克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"我們當然有一些手段......但不代表我們要把這些手段無保留地告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真這麼想，感染者，你該把我留在那家該死的醫院裡，等著無胄盟來拷問我——而不是救我出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼和我講話，我們都是各取所需才會站在這裡的，只憑你的身價，你配和我對話嗎？灰毫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你把我帶出來，我就要對你感激涕零了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"狂妄的貴族——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——好了好了，我是不反對你們現在打一架，現在打一架總比在面對無胄盟的時候捅刀子要強——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"——我們好歹也做這件事有幾年了......我們有一些政府管道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道卡西米爾最痛恨商業聯合會的，除了那些日子都過不下去的窮人和感染者......還有誰嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要嘛是我瘋了，要嘛是卡西米爾瘋了......你們該不會要說，一群感染者，在和監正會做交易，為了打擊聯合會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你如今的處境，看看騎士們，瑟奇亞克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"——他們早瘋了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
